.Dd June 23, 2026
.Dt LOCAL-CI 8
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm local-ci
.Nd Colima maintenance and local GitHub Actions runs
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Ar args
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
maintains the Colima container runtime and runs GitHub Actions locally via
.Xr act 1 .
Observability runs natively on the OTel Collector and OpenObserve
.Pq Xr openobserve-ctl 8 , Cm zsvc o2 ;
the containerized LGTM stack this tool once managed was removed (Z-134).
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width reset-password
.It Cm prune
Prune Docker containers, images, and build cache; dry run by default, destructive with
.Fl f .
.It Cm rebuild
Delete and recreate the Colima VM (destructive).
.It Cm run Op Ar args
Run GitHub Actions locally via act.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_CI_MEMORY
.It Ev ZDOTS_CI_CPU
Colima vCPU count.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CI_MEMORY
Colima memory in GB.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CI_DISK
Colima disk in GB.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr openobserve-ctl 8 ,
.Xr zdots-ctl 8
